independently. `:program` takes map-AST or\n146\t   datom batches, `:rows` row sets; `:encoder` and `:evaluator` are the two\n147\t   `run-on-stream` sessions.\"\n148\t  ([vm] (make-encoder-session vm default-capacity))\n149\t  ([vm capacity]\n150\t   (let [program (make-attachment capacity)\n151\t         rows (make-attachment capacity)]\n152\t     {:program (:writer program)\n153\t      :encoder {:observer (:observer program), :consumer (:writer rows)}\n154\t      :rows (:writer rows)"}
